>VpŚ
tasmāt tavāhaṃ na samarpayiṣye kapotakaṃ śyena yad atra yuktaṃ | tvaṃ manyase tat karavāṇi sarvvamṛte kapotāt__ khalu satyam atra ||
>VpBh
tasmāt tavāhaṃ na samarthayiṣye kapotakaṃ na yad atra yuktaṃ | tvaṃ manyase tat karavāṇi sarvam ṛte kapotāt khalu satyam atra || 20 ||
>VpBh-A
tasmāt tavāhaṃ na samarthayiṣye kapotakaṃ vāyabhīti yuktaṃ | tvaṃ manyase tat karavāṇi sarvam ṛte kapotāt khalu satyāv atra || 20 ||
